1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,067
Room nine. Thirty desks. Thick, warm,
stale air. Somebody has closed every
window against the cold.

2
00:00:06,567 --> 00:00:11,133
Chalk dust hangs in the air. Your
chest closes like a fist. One puff.
Two left.

3
00:00:11,633 --> 00:00:16,767
Rule four. Open two windows, on
opposite walls. Moving air carries
germs away.

4
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:20,967
It's freezing! Mister Frank said
forty-one kids, zero complaints.

5
00:00:21,467 --> 00:00:27,033
They roll the desks into rows, face
the board, and call out one by one.
Junie counts. Forty-one.
